  8+  80E6              ; PRINTAT - Print a string in a position and attributes as per registers:
  9+  80E6              ;		IN	A	: Bit 7=1 For Flash / Bit 6=1 For Brigh / Bit 5,4,3 for Paper / Bit 2,1,0 for Ink
